- Simple, succinct, technical, factual
- Active voice, concrete examples, consistent terminology
- Lean with links to docs site
- Structure:  
 - Apps: Description -> Additional Info (optional) → Links, no duplication ( links to docs site ) -> pnpm commands list
 - Packages: Description -> Usage -> Additional Info (optional) → Links, no duplication ( links to docs site ) -> pnpm commands list